{
    "test_name": "MOB.865_MaterialLookup_Item_Attachments",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.865_MaterialLookup_Item_Attachments",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.865` **The storeroom item modal's `Photos` / `Docs` segments, and the row avatar image modal.**\n- READ-ONLY. Nothing is uploaded, adjusted or submitted; the modal is closed on the way out.\n- \u2b50 **The segment set is pinned by VALUE**: `Quantity Adjustment` \u00b7 `Stock Item` \u00b7 `Photos` \u00b7\n  `Docs` (`1`..`4`), switched by clicking the radio input, never by label text (\u00a722).\n- \u2b50 **Photos vs Docs is a biconditional** (`MOB.741`'s shape on a third parent type,\n  `MaterialItem`): `Add Photo` and no `Add File`, then `Add File`, no `Add Photo`, no carousel.\n  \ud83d\uded1 Neither button is clicked \u2014 `FileAttachments` has no image filter, so an upload lands.\n- Whether the fixture item has photos/documents is \ud83d\udcca reported, not asserted.\n- \u2b50 **The avatar modal is an exclusive-or**: either the row has no image button, or clicking\n  it opens the (same) modal showing `img.file-image`. The branch taken is recorded.\n- Fixture: `000-000-000 Adamantium` in `Central Storeroom`.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Material Lookup",
            "Photos",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
        "options": {
